      "content": "it’s not that simple tho. there aren't really any \"small steps\" when every single part of my life is controlled. like, even my thoughts feel like they don't belong to me. it's not just pressure, it's like... i'm a prisoner in my own skin. i feel like i'm just waiting for something to end.",
